  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n** (First term ÷ 2) × Second term = Third term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given set:\n\n(12, 18, 108)\n\n(__**12 **____**÷ 2**__) × 18 = 108\n\n__**6 × 18**__ = 108\n\n108 = 108\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (22, 18, 198) \n\n(__22 ____÷ 2__) × 18 = 198\n\n__11 × 18__ = 198\n\n198 = 198\n\nOption 2) (18, 16, 144)\n\n(__18 ____÷ 2__) × 16 = 144\n\n__9 × 16__ = 144\n\n144 = 144\n\nOption 3) (28, 14, 196)\n\n(__28 ____÷ 2__) × 14 = 196\n\n__14 × 14__ = 196\n\n196 = 196\n\nOption 4) (16, 12, 156) \n\n(__16 ____÷ 2__) × 12 = 156\n\n__8 × 12__ = 156\n\n96 ≠ 156\n\nHence, the correct option is** \"option (4)\".**",
